    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge Together<i> </i>is a blacksmith simulation where you craft and sell weapons for different villagers in the marketplace.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/dae0d7d0696188f09193020a1e13f71e.poster.avif?t=1734154594\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/dae0d7d0696188f09193020a1e13f71e.webm?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/dae0d7d0696188f09193020a1e13f71e.mp4?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your masterpiece:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smelt ore and shape them into the blade of your choosing. Add hilts to complete your weapon and ready them for sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/348fa41a1791a090004466168338de56.poster.avif?t=1734154594\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/348fa41a1791a090004466168338de56.webm?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/348fa41a1791a090004466168338de56.mp4?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your creation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate with villagers to maximize profit. Charge a reasonable price, or you\u2019ll risk losing a valuable customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/e921a4b96693ca0a4bed34b580083048.poster.avif?t=1734154594\" width=752 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/e921a4b96693ca0a4bed34b580083048.webm?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/e921a4b96693ca0a4bed34b580083048.mp4?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge Together<i> </i>is a blacksmith simulation where you craft and sell weapons for different villagers in the marketplace.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/dae0d7d0696188f09193020a1e13f71e.poster.avif?t=1734154594\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/dae0d7d0696188f09193020a1e13f71e.webm?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/dae0d7d0696188f09193020a1e13f71e.mp4?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your masterpiece:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smelt ore and shape them into the blade of your choosing. Add hilts to complete your weapon and ready them for sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/348fa41a1791a090004466168338de56.poster.avif?t=1734154594\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/348fa41a1791a090004466168338de56.webm?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/348fa41a1791a090004466168338de56.mp4?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell your creation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiate with villagers to maximize profit. Charge a reasonable price, or you\u2019ll risk losing a valuable customer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/e921a4b96693ca0a4bed34b580083048.poster.avif?t=1734154594\" width=752 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/e921a4b96693ca0a4bed34b580083048.webm?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349730/extras/e921a4b96693ca0a4bed34b580083048.mp4?t=1734154594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
